WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:38.160
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:38.240 --> 01:40.840
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:46.000 --> 01:47.200
More to the left.

01:47.720 --> 01:48.640
Left?

01:48.720 --> 01:49.800
- Come help me.
- No.

01:49.880 --> 01:51.160
- Coming.
- A little to the right.

01:51.640 --> 01:52.760
- Like this?
- Yes.

01:52.840 --> 01:54.040
- Right there.
- All right.

01:54.800 --> 01:56.840
Ma'am, the beans and saddle are ready.

01:57.360 --> 01:58.720
- Put them inside.
- Yes.

02:02.920 --> 02:04.240
What are those for?

02:04.800 --> 02:06.760
- Those beans and saddle.
- Be careful.

02:06.840 --> 02:08.880
These are the wedding customs
in the Mortal World.

02:08.960 --> 02:10.800
To sprinkle beans and cross the saddle.

02:10.880 --> 02:12.720
Beans are auspicious
and can ward off evil.

02:12.800 --> 02:15.080
Crossing the saddle signifies safety.

02:15.160 --> 02:16.480
These are wishes to the couple

02:16.560 --> 02:19.120
for a happy and safe life after marriage.

02:19.200 --> 02:21.480
But we didn't have much time,

02:21.560 --> 02:22.960
so we can only keep it simple.

02:23.040 --> 02:26.200
Otherwise, there's giving
of betrothal geese, walking on sacks,

02:26.280 --> 02:28.600
proposing, checking bazi, choosing
an auspicious day, picking up the bride.

02:28.680 --> 02:30.400
There are many customs.

02:30.880 --> 02:33.240
There are so many wedding customs
in the Mortal World.

02:33.920 --> 02:34.840
There is also

02:34.920 --> 02:36.440
a wedding custom in the Dragon Clan.

02:37.520 --> 02:39.720
A man will scrape off
his hardest dragon scale

02:40.600 --> 02:42.880
and give it to his wife.

02:44.080 --> 02:45.320
Scrape off the dragon scale?

02:46.040 --> 02:47.880
That is too cruel.

02:48.880 --> 02:50.400
Without the dragon scale's protection,

02:50.480 --> 02:52.480
it's like exposing his most fragile part

02:52.560 --> 02:53.720
to the person he loves.

02:55.200 --> 02:56.360
It means

02:56.440 --> 02:58.040
he's willing to listen to her,

02:59.360 --> 03:00.640
be bullied by her,

03:01.960 --> 03:03.360
and be deceived by her.

03:16.000 --> 03:19.000
I'm going to check the wedding dress
for Orchid.

03:19.080 --> 03:20.280
I'm very busy today.

03:20.360 --> 03:22.400
I don't have time to listen
to Dragon Clan's weird fetish.

03:34.280 --> 03:36.360
ORCHID RESIDENCE

03:36.440 --> 03:37.720
We've searched the house,

03:37.800 --> 03:39.000
but we couldn't find it.

03:40.440 --> 03:42.760
We've searched everywhere outside
but still couldn't find it.

03:43.360 --> 03:45.240
That's a premium bead from the East Sea.

03:45.320 --> 03:47.400
I'll deduct your annual salary
if you can't find it.

03:52.480 --> 03:54.160
Jieli.

03:54.240 --> 03:55.680
This is a fake wedding.

03:55.760 --> 03:56.920
Don't be so angry.

03:57.560 --> 04:00.400
Even if the wedding is fake,
the bead is real.

04:00.480 --> 04:01.720
It's worth a lot of money.

04:02.280 --> 04:03.840
After the show, I need…

04:05.600 --> 04:07.000
to keep it for Mr. Dongfang.

04:09.120 --> 04:10.000
You girls,

04:10.080 --> 04:11.640
find it in the east yard with me.

04:11.720 --> 04:12.800
- Yes.
- Yes.

04:20.000 --> 04:21.160
It's almost time.

04:21.720 --> 04:23.720
Why haven't you changed
into the wedding dress yet?

04:23.800 --> 04:25.280
Lady Wanqing.

04:25.360 --> 04:26.560
Why are you here?

04:26.640 --> 04:28.840
I heard you lost your jewelry.

04:28.920 --> 04:30.960
I don't know if you can find it.

04:32.280 --> 04:33.720
So I brought all my jewelry

04:33.800 --> 04:35.040
to you.

04:35.880 --> 04:38.240
See if there's anything you like.

04:38.880 --> 04:41.280
A girl's wedding is very important.

04:41.360 --> 04:43.200
You need to dress up to look beautiful.

04:44.880 --> 04:45.720
Sit.

04:54.240 --> 04:55.920
This one looks nice.

04:56.000 --> 04:57.560
It suits your complexion very well.

04:57.640 --> 04:58.840
Let me put it on you.

04:58.920 --> 05:00.000
There's no need.

05:13.960 --> 05:15.240
Thank you, Lady Wanqing.

05:16.240 --> 05:17.360
Why are you so shy?

05:20.520 --> 05:21.760
After tonight,

05:21.840 --> 05:24.000
I'll be your sister-in-law.

05:25.200 --> 05:26.320
Logically speaking,

05:26.400 --> 05:27.360
I should care more

05:27.440 --> 05:29.000
about your wedding.

05:29.080 --> 05:31.160
Although Mr. Dongfang is your brother,

05:31.240 --> 05:32.920
he is a man.

05:33.000 --> 05:34.960
He is not that thoughtful.

05:35.440 --> 05:38.280
If you have any worries or difficulties
that you can't tell him about

05:38.360 --> 05:39.720
in the future,

05:40.200 --> 05:41.840
just let me know.

05:52.760 --> 05:53.680
Let's go.

05:53.760 --> 05:55.000
Come on, Mr. Dongfang, hurry.

05:55.080 --> 05:56.800
I told you.
I have no family or friends in Lucheng.

05:56.880 --> 05:57.960
No one will send me gifts.

05:58.040 --> 05:58.920
Just go by yourself.

05:59.000 --> 06:00.320
You never know.

06:00.400 --> 06:02.160
Congratulations,
Xiao Run and Mr. Dongfang.

06:02.240 --> 06:04.080
- Thank you.
- Here are two purple jade bracelets.

06:04.160 --> 06:05.640
One for each of you.

06:08.640 --> 06:09.720
Thank you.

06:09.800 --> 06:10.640
Please come in.

06:10.720 --> 06:12.080
After you.

06:12.160 --> 06:13.760
Congratulations, Xiao Run, Mr. Dongfang.

06:13.840 --> 06:16.000
This Youyang Scroll is for you.

06:16.080 --> 06:17.040
Thank you.

06:17.760 --> 06:19.720
And two jars of good wine from Green Lake.

06:20.520 --> 06:22.640
- Thank you. Please come in.
- We must get drunk today.

06:25.120 --> 06:26.040
What's going on?

06:27.400 --> 06:29.920
Didn't you say
that you don't have friends in Lucheng?

06:30.000 --> 06:31.120
You're wrong.

06:31.200 --> 06:32.080
First,

06:32.160 --> 06:33.400
we are sworn brothers.

06:33.480 --> 06:34.360
Second,

06:34.440 --> 06:35.920
after this wedding,

06:36.000 --> 06:37.800
you'll be my brother-in-law.

06:38.760 --> 06:39.800
So?

06:40.680 --> 06:41.560
So

06:41.640 --> 06:43.800
I made it clear on the wedding invitation.

06:43.880 --> 06:45.080
If they send a gift to me,

06:45.160 --> 06:46.160
they need to send you one.

06:46.240 --> 06:47.200
From now on,

06:47.280 --> 06:48.160
my friends

06:48.240 --> 06:49.480
are your friends.

06:49.560 --> 06:51.440
They have to consider you
their brother-in-law

06:51.520 --> 06:52.760
like me.

06:57.840 --> 06:58.960
Are you touched?

06:59.640 --> 07:00.800
It's nothing.

07:00.880 --> 07:01.760
Look.

07:01.840 --> 07:03.280
From there to there.

07:03.360 --> 07:04.720
As long as I have it,

07:04.800 --> 07:06.880
you, my brother-in-law,

07:06.960 --> 07:08.280
must have it too.

07:08.360 --> 07:10.600
Congratulations, Xiao Run, Mr. Dongfang.

07:11.080 --> 07:12.040
Thank you.

07:12.520 --> 07:14.040
- Come in, please.
- Please come in.

07:14.120 --> 07:15.000
- Please.
- Congratulations.

07:15.080 --> 07:16.760
- Congratulations.
- Greet them. I'll entertain them inside.

07:20.400 --> 07:21.800
- Let's go inside.
- Congratulations, Xiao Run.

07:21.880 --> 07:22.880
Please come in.

07:22.960 --> 07:23.920
Please come in.

07:24.480 --> 07:25.320
Let's go.

07:38.280 --> 07:39.760
Why are you hiding here?

07:44.960 --> 07:46.320
That's my question.

07:46.880 --> 07:48.240
You should be entertaining guests.

07:48.320 --> 07:49.400
Why are you here?

07:50.000 --> 07:50.880
I…

07:51.560 --> 07:52.480
I'm going now.

07:55.400 --> 07:56.520
Wait.

07:58.160 --> 07:59.680
I'm in a bad mood.

08:00.200 --> 08:01.680
Chat with me.

08:18.920 --> 08:20.560
In Arbiter Hall before,

08:22.000 --> 08:24.760
I had to organize
a lot of mortals' Destiny Books every day.

08:25.400 --> 08:26.720
But at that time,

08:26.800 --> 08:28.240
their birth, death,

08:28.320 --> 08:29.640
joy, sorrow, parting, and reunion

08:29.720 --> 08:31.240
are just like a red leaf

08:31.320 --> 08:32.559
on the fate tree

08:32.640 --> 08:34.679
for me.

08:34.760 --> 08:36.600
The leaf blooms and it falls.

08:37.840 --> 08:39.039
It falls and then blooms.

08:39.600 --> 08:41.679
Everything is predestined.

08:41.760 --> 08:43.120
But now,

08:43.200 --> 08:44.280
after these few days

08:44.840 --> 08:45.920
in the Mortal World

08:47.120 --> 08:48.240
in Lucheng,

08:49.920 --> 08:51.080
I discovered

08:52.240 --> 08:54.080
that marriage, funerals,

08:54.160 --> 08:55.640
happiness, and sadness

08:56.200 --> 08:58.160
are very important things.

09:02.360 --> 09:05.160
Just now,
when Lady Wanqing came to me happily

09:05.240 --> 09:06.840
and placed a golden hairpin on my hair,

09:06.920 --> 09:08.800
I felt really sad.

09:08.880 --> 09:12.040
Although I know she is destined
to die tonight,

09:12.600 --> 09:13.880
at the thought

09:14.360 --> 09:16.120
that we lied to her

09:16.200 --> 09:17.800
and she's going to die tonight,

09:19.960 --> 09:21.400
I feel so…

09:22.480 --> 09:23.320
Forget it.

09:24.320 --> 09:25.920
I've told you so much,

09:26.000 --> 09:27.000
but you don't understand.

09:27.080 --> 09:28.280
I do.

09:29.240 --> 09:31.240
This is the first time I felt this too.

09:32.840 --> 09:34.360
Xiao Run told me earlier

09:35.480 --> 09:36.880
that his friends

09:36.960 --> 09:38.320
are my friends.

09:38.800 --> 09:40.720
Towards a mortal…

09:41.920 --> 09:42.840
No.

09:45.200 --> 09:46.360
Towards an enemy,

09:47.760 --> 09:48.880
I can't believe I'd feel guilty.

09:49.360 --> 09:51.120
He is Xiao Run.

09:51.200 --> 09:52.640
He's not Changheng.

09:53.840 --> 09:55.440
He is not your enemy.

10:03.360 --> 10:04.240
Tonight,

10:05.600 --> 10:06.840
can we

10:09.400 --> 10:10.720
forget about the Fairy Tribe,

10:11.240 --> 10:12.720
the Moon Tribe,

10:13.280 --> 10:14.720
and the differences between them?

10:15.320 --> 10:16.520
You are not the Moon Supreme

10:16.600 --> 10:18.360
nor am I a fairy.

10:21.320 --> 10:23.160
Let's be mortals for a day.

10:24.600 --> 10:25.560
All right?

10:27.200 --> 10:28.040
All right.

10:37.200 --> 10:38.040
Here.

10:39.120 --> 10:40.000
Enjoy. Excuse me.

10:40.080 --> 10:41.160
Congratulations.

10:41.240 --> 10:42.080
Congratulations.

10:47.200 --> 10:48.040
Cricket.

10:50.320 --> 10:52.360
You're finally back? Where have you been?

10:58.680 --> 11:00.800
It's my wedding day.
What's with your facial expression?

11:04.320 --> 11:05.200
Forget it.

11:05.280 --> 11:06.920
Let's go. Get changed.

11:12.760 --> 11:13.600
Cricket.

11:14.080 --> 11:14.920
Tell me honestly.

11:15.000 --> 11:15.920
Where did you go today?

11:18.880 --> 11:19.760
Tell me.

11:21.520 --> 11:22.360
Cricket--

11:24.800 --> 11:25.880
Cricket.

11:25.960 --> 11:27.440
What are you doing?

11:28.720 --> 11:29.800
Cricket.

11:29.880 --> 11:30.920
Cricket.

11:38.800 --> 11:39.720
Why are you crying?

11:42.080 --> 11:43.240
Did you get dumped?

11:48.920 --> 11:49.760
Or are you in debt?

11:57.000 --> 11:57.880
I know.

11:58.560 --> 11:59.760
Do you think I'll leave you

11:59.840 --> 12:01.000
after I get married?

12:03.520 --> 12:05.560
Don't worry.
We've known each other since childhood.

12:05.640 --> 12:06.520
We're like brothers.

12:06.600 --> 12:07.560
How can I leave you?

12:08.440 --> 12:09.280
Look.

12:09.360 --> 12:11.000
Today is my wedding day.

12:11.840 --> 12:13.160
After I get married,

12:13.240 --> 12:15.800
I'll find you a beautiful girl
from a good family, all right?

12:16.400 --> 12:17.320
Don't cry.

12:20.160 --> 12:21.040
Get dressed.

12:32.640 --> 12:33.520
Cricket.

12:34.120 --> 12:35.840
Isn't this the bead on the Phoenix Crown?

12:35.920 --> 12:36.880
Why is it here?

12:37.480 --> 12:38.800
Give it to Lady Orchid.

12:38.880 --> 12:41.200
She's applying makeup
in the west yard with Lady Wanqing.

12:41.280 --> 12:42.560
Hurry up. Go.

13:02.120 --> 13:03.160
You are

13:04.560 --> 13:06.520
the servant of Xiao Run.

13:07.160 --> 13:08.480
What are you doing here?

13:12.400 --> 13:15.040
Lady Orchid, a bead on the Phoenix Crown

13:16.040 --> 13:18.000
is left
in my young master's wedding attire.

13:18.880 --> 13:19.920
I came to bring it.

13:21.960 --> 13:24.000
So it was left with him.

13:24.080 --> 13:25.000
Follow me.

13:34.560 --> 13:35.440
How strange.

13:35.520 --> 13:36.880
She was here just now.

13:39.480 --> 13:40.680
Qu Shui.

13:41.240 --> 13:42.600
Why are you here?

13:46.040 --> 13:48.240
Xiao Run asked me to give this to you.

13:52.720 --> 13:53.560
He…

13:54.080 --> 13:57.160
He asked me to tell Lady Orchid something.

13:57.720 --> 13:59.760
They'll be husband and wife
in a few hours.

13:59.840 --> 14:01.360
He is so clingy.

14:02.640 --> 14:03.520
Forget it.

14:04.040 --> 14:05.120
I can't hear

14:05.200 --> 14:06.560
his secrets for you.

14:32.160 --> 14:33.200
Orchid.

14:34.560 --> 14:36.240
You look good in your wedding dress.

14:37.560 --> 14:38.840
It took you so much effort

14:38.920 --> 14:40.480
to finally marry him.

14:40.560 --> 14:41.800
Are you happy now?

14:46.240 --> 14:47.520
Qu Shui.

14:49.160 --> 14:50.000
No.

14:50.920 --> 14:52.280
Are you Danyin?

14:54.960 --> 14:55.840
What's the matter?

14:55.920 --> 14:57.320
Are you afraid I'll ruin your plan?

14:59.880 --> 15:01.040
This facial expression.

15:01.120 --> 15:02.320
This tone.

15:02.400 --> 15:03.640
You were this way

15:03.720 --> 15:04.880
when you bullied me before.

15:05.440 --> 15:06.560
Fairy Danyin.

15:06.640 --> 15:07.720
It's really you.

15:08.200 --> 15:09.400
What are you doing?

15:10.520 --> 15:13.760
I just haven't seen someone
from Shuiyuntian for a long time.

15:13.840 --> 15:15.080
I'm a little excited.

15:16.320 --> 15:17.600
By the way,

15:17.680 --> 15:20.160
why did you and Lord Changheng come
to Mortal World to experience tribulation?

15:20.240 --> 15:21.600
Can you explain it to me?

15:21.680 --> 15:23.120
You should tell me

15:23.640 --> 15:26.040
why you are hanging out
with Dongfang Qingcang first.

15:26.600 --> 15:28.080
And you two look close.

15:29.760 --> 15:32.200
It's a long story.

15:32.280 --> 15:33.160
Forget it.

15:33.840 --> 15:35.280
I'll settle this with you later on.

15:36.080 --> 15:37.440
The most important thing now

15:38.000 --> 15:39.680
is to find a way to save Lord Changheng.

15:40.520 --> 15:42.760
Lord Yunzhong already knew
about the tribulation.

15:42.840 --> 15:45.000
In order to stop Dongfang Qingcang,

15:46.760 --> 15:47.720
he asked me…

15:48.680 --> 15:49.800
What did he ask you to do?

15:49.880 --> 15:52.000
He asked me to kill
the former God of War's mortal body

15:52.520 --> 15:53.720
to stop the tribulation.

15:53.800 --> 15:55.360
Kill Lady Wanqing?

15:55.440 --> 15:56.320
Why?

15:56.400 --> 15:59.280
Wasn't the former God of War
a hero of Shuiyuntian?

15:59.360 --> 16:00.280
Besides, if we do this,

16:00.360 --> 16:02.320
Lord Changheng's spirit
will dissipate too.

16:02.400 --> 16:03.600
Lord Yunzhong said

16:04.160 --> 16:05.360
we have to sacrifice Changheng

16:06.360 --> 16:08.040
for Shuiyuntian.

16:09.000 --> 16:10.160
But I don't want to do that.

16:10.240 --> 16:11.720
Of course.

16:11.800 --> 16:12.640
Fairy Danyin.

16:12.720 --> 16:14.920
We must find a way to protect them.

16:15.000 --> 16:16.160
Of course.

16:16.240 --> 16:17.440
Even if I die,

16:17.520 --> 16:18.680
I will protect Changheng.

16:19.480 --> 16:20.320
Orchid,

16:20.400 --> 16:21.400
tell me.

16:21.480 --> 16:23.320
How can I help them
experience tribulation smoothly?

16:25.000 --> 16:26.760
According to the fate poem,

16:26.840 --> 16:28.760
on the wedding night,

16:28.840 --> 16:30.800
Xiao Run must kill Lady Wanqing,

16:30.880 --> 16:32.880
then they can deal with this smoothly
and ascend.

16:33.440 --> 16:35.200
With Xiao Run's personality,

16:35.280 --> 16:36.800
how can he kill people?

16:37.720 --> 16:39.320
I don't know.

16:39.400 --> 16:40.520
You don't know?

16:41.480 --> 16:43.440
Then why are you doing this?

16:43.520 --> 16:44.600
To try your luck?

16:45.160 --> 16:46.840
Calm down, Fairy Danyin.

16:46.920 --> 16:48.280
I've read so many Destiny Books.

16:48.360 --> 16:50.800
There are weirder fate poems than this.

16:50.880 --> 16:53.240
But before the tribulation happens,

16:53.320 --> 16:55.440
I can't figure out the meaning either.

16:55.520 --> 16:56.680
Let's wait and see.

16:56.760 --> 16:58.200
We can't just stand by.

17:01.320 --> 17:03.000
He cares about you the most now.

17:03.840 --> 17:05.240
If there is no other way,

17:05.319 --> 17:07.119
I will hold a knife on your neck

17:07.200 --> 17:08.280
and force him.

17:09.119 --> 17:11.119
Are you serious?

17:11.200 --> 17:12.119
Of course.

17:12.599 --> 17:13.800
If that doesn't work,

17:13.880 --> 17:15.319
I'll cut you.

17:15.400 --> 17:16.839
I don't believe he won't do it.

17:18.319 --> 17:19.400
I have to go.

17:19.480 --> 17:21.040
Let's improvise tonight.

17:21.680 --> 17:22.720
Fairy Danyin.

17:25.359 --> 17:26.839
- Lord Ronghao.
- Lord Ronghao.

17:27.640 --> 17:29.120
Why are you in Lucheng?

17:29.200 --> 17:30.400
Changheng is in danger.

17:30.480 --> 17:31.720
I can't ignore him.

17:33.280 --> 17:35.800
Even if Changheng
can deal with it this time,

17:35.880 --> 17:37.280
if he wants to leave safely,

17:37.360 --> 17:38.880
there's one person we must keep an eye on.

17:40.480 --> 17:41.840
Are you referring

17:41.920 --> 17:43.760
to Dongfang Qingcang?

17:45.160 --> 17:47.320
Dongfang Qingcang is powerful.

17:47.400 --> 17:50.640
In the three realms, the only one
that can fight with him is Changheng.

17:50.720 --> 17:53.360
And tonight is a good chance
to get rid of Changheng,

17:53.440 --> 17:56.360
so Dongfang Qingcang
will definitely kill him.

17:56.440 --> 17:58.880
We need to find a way to lure him away.

18:04.200 --> 18:05.320
Fairy Orchid.

18:05.400 --> 18:07.920
You are the only one who can do that.

18:08.000 --> 18:10.520
Because he doesn't believe anyone
aside from you.

18:11.160 --> 18:12.720
And only you

18:12.800 --> 18:13.920
can get close to him.

18:14.000 --> 18:15.120
I…

18:15.920 --> 18:16.920
But…

18:17.000 --> 18:18.080
But what?

18:18.720 --> 18:19.680
Orchid.

18:20.200 --> 18:21.680
Do you want to save Changheng or not?

18:21.760 --> 18:23.240
Of course I do.

18:23.320 --> 18:24.240
That's it.

18:26.920 --> 18:28.320
There's something

18:28.880 --> 18:30.400
that you might not know yet.

18:31.600 --> 18:33.640
Fairy Orchid, aren't you curious

18:33.720 --> 18:36.520
why Changheng was willing to risk his life

18:36.600 --> 18:39.320
by jumping off Shenshui Hall
to experience tribulation?

18:41.320 --> 18:42.440
You don't understand my feeling

18:43.000 --> 18:45.040
because you've never loved someone
like I do.

18:49.120 --> 18:51.400
Lord Changheng is experiencing tribulation

18:51.480 --> 18:52.800
because of me?

18:57.240 --> 18:59.840
Because you have always been

19:00.320 --> 19:01.600
the one he loves.

19:03.520 --> 19:05.800
Due to Changheng's engagement
with the Goddess,

19:05.880 --> 19:07.240
he couldn't tell you.

19:08.360 --> 19:09.640
So over the years,

19:10.120 --> 19:11.760
he had looked for the Goddess everywhere

19:12.320 --> 19:13.720
to break off the engagement

19:14.200 --> 19:16.480
and be with you openly.

19:17.720 --> 19:19.000
And that Firefly Stone.

19:19.960 --> 19:21.760
He traveled around and found it

19:22.480 --> 19:24.080
for you.

19:26.640 --> 19:28.400
You shouldn't hear these things from me.

19:29.080 --> 19:30.720
But since the situation is critical,

19:30.800 --> 19:32.640
I have to say it.

19:34.000 --> 19:34.920
Fairy Orchid.

19:35.760 --> 19:37.240
I don't know if you will appreciate

19:37.720 --> 19:39.080
the effort Changheng exerted

19:39.160 --> 19:40.160
for you.

19:41.120 --> 19:42.760
But his situation now

19:42.840 --> 19:44.000
was caused by you.

19:44.520 --> 19:45.360
Orchid.

19:46.040 --> 19:47.680
Why are you hesitating?

19:47.760 --> 19:49.320
If Lord Changheng is gone,

19:49.400 --> 19:50.880
who else can fight with him?

19:54.000 --> 19:55.920
Dongfang Qingcang is not a bad person.

19:56.440 --> 19:58.560
He is not what you think.

19:58.640 --> 20:00.280
- He--
- How dare you defend him?

20:00.960 --> 20:01.840
Are you crazy?

20:04.720 --> 20:06.120
Fairy Orchid.

20:06.200 --> 20:07.080
Do you know?

20:07.880 --> 20:09.120
If Dongfang Qingcang

20:09.200 --> 20:10.760
takes my master's primordial spirit,

20:11.360 --> 20:12.640
not only can't I see my master,

20:13.200 --> 20:15.240
but the three realms
will also be in misery.

20:15.320 --> 20:17.440
Many people will lose their families.

20:21.360 --> 20:22.520
Lord Ronghao.

20:23.080 --> 20:24.600
What are you talking about?

20:24.680 --> 20:25.800
Don't you know?

20:26.360 --> 20:27.280
What does

20:27.360 --> 20:28.920
Dongfang Qingcang want?

20:29.000 --> 20:30.120
Please tell me.

20:30.600 --> 20:31.840
Dongfang Qingcang

20:32.360 --> 20:34.360
wants to take
my master's primordial spirit

20:34.920 --> 20:36.440
to break the seal of the Shuofeng Sword

20:36.520 --> 20:37.880
and regain 100,000 soldiers

20:38.400 --> 20:39.960
to fight against Shuiyuntian.

20:41.600 --> 20:42.520
That's impossible.

20:44.000 --> 20:45.320
That's impossible.

20:45.400 --> 20:46.640
It's true.

20:47.120 --> 20:48.640
In the war 30,000 years ago,

20:49.640 --> 20:50.760
the former God of War

20:51.240 --> 20:52.240
sealed 100,000 soldiers

20:52.320 --> 20:53.800
with the Shuofeng Sword.

20:54.640 --> 20:55.840
My master's spiritual mark

20:56.400 --> 20:57.680
is on the Shuofeng Sword.

20:58.160 --> 20:59.600
The seal can only be broken

21:00.280 --> 21:01.760
with my master's primordial spirit.

21:04.080 --> 21:05.000
Did you come to Lucheng

21:05.760 --> 21:07.720
just to relax?

21:08.400 --> 21:09.600
Or is there something else?

21:14.160 --> 21:15.360
Nothing else.

21:15.840 --> 21:17.560
Are you lying to me?

21:17.640 --> 21:18.720
No.

21:19.360 --> 21:20.360
I'm just here to relax.

21:27.880 --> 21:29.200
Lord Ronghao.

21:30.880 --> 21:32.400
What should I do?

21:35.600 --> 21:36.880
This is a bottle

21:36.960 --> 21:38.160
of poison.

21:38.240 --> 21:40.600
It can weaken his power temporarily

21:40.680 --> 21:42.040
and stall him for a while.

21:42.120 --> 21:43.080
During that time,

21:43.160 --> 21:45.040
I can take my master's primordial spirit

21:45.120 --> 21:47.680
and leave with Changheng safely.

21:48.720 --> 21:49.800
I'm counting on you.

22:07.240 --> 22:08.280
Lady Orchid.

22:08.360 --> 22:09.480
It's almost an auspicious time.

22:12.240 --> 22:13.400
Where are you?

22:13.480 --> 22:14.600
- Orchid.
- Lady Orchid!

22:16.240 --> 22:17.960
Make sure he takes the poison

22:18.520 --> 22:20.320
and make sure nothing goes wrong.

22:20.400 --> 22:21.240
Got it?

22:27.800 --> 22:28.640
Yes.

22:29.120 --> 22:30.360
I believe

22:31.240 --> 22:33.200
you won't ignore Changheng

22:33.680 --> 22:35.800
and watch the three realms suffer
from the war

22:36.280 --> 22:37.600
and plunge into misery.

22:57.160 --> 22:58.320
Nice.

23:00.720 --> 23:01.960
Very nice.

23:32.400 --> 23:33.360
Congratulations.

23:33.440 --> 23:35.320
- Congratulations. It's so lively.
- Congratulations.

23:36.160 --> 23:37.560
Congratulations.

23:37.640 --> 23:39.640
Xiao Run, we're going to toast
to Mr. Dongfang.

23:39.720 --> 23:40.840
- All right.
- Let's go.

23:42.720 --> 23:43.760
Mr. Dongfang.

23:43.840 --> 23:45.560
Mr. Dongfang, congratulations.

23:45.640 --> 23:46.800
May you have a baby soon.

23:46.880 --> 23:48.040
Let me fill up your cup.

23:48.120 --> 23:49.400
How about I drink from the jar?

23:49.480 --> 23:50.680
- All right.
- Here.

23:51.280 --> 23:52.200
You're a good drinker.

23:52.280 --> 23:55.200
- Mr. Dongfang, here's a toast to you.
- A toast to you.

23:55.280 --> 23:56.120
Here.

24:01.120 --> 24:02.920
- Congratulations.
- Let me fill this up again.

24:03.720 --> 24:05.000
- This way.
- Be careful.

24:07.760 --> 24:08.920
Slow down.

24:09.720 --> 24:10.720
Come on.

24:11.400 --> 24:12.680
- Here.
- May you have a baby soon.

24:12.760 --> 24:14.040
Watch your steps.

24:14.120 --> 24:15.120
- Be careful.
- All right.

24:25.960 --> 24:28.400
DONGFANG MANSION

24:34.080 --> 24:36.800
JADE RESIDENCE

24:46.800 --> 24:48.000
I'm happy today,

24:48.480 --> 24:49.960
so I drank more.

24:55.280 --> 24:57.120
Forgive me

24:57.200 --> 24:58.440
if I smell bad.

25:02.960 --> 25:03.840
My bride.

25:04.440 --> 25:05.920
We're the only ones in the room.

25:06.680 --> 25:08.360
You can put down the fan now.

25:19.280 --> 25:20.360
Lady Wanqing.

25:20.880 --> 25:21.760
Why are you here?

25:25.600 --> 25:27.920
Those servants must have been drunk

25:28.000 --> 25:29.560
and sent you to the wrong wedding room.

25:31.520 --> 25:32.680
Please wait for a moment.

25:32.760 --> 25:34.000
I'll go get someone.

25:34.480 --> 25:35.560
It's all right.

25:37.640 --> 25:38.480
Cricket.

25:38.960 --> 25:39.800
Cricket.

25:57.680 --> 25:59.400
Xiao Run and Lady Wanqing

25:59.480 --> 26:01.240
have already met in the wedding room.

26:02.360 --> 26:04.200
We just need to wait

26:05.840 --> 26:07.800
for their destiny to happen.

26:10.400 --> 26:11.280
Don't you think

26:12.040 --> 26:13.960
this feels a little familiar tonight?

26:14.960 --> 26:16.600
At that time,
you had just arrived Cangyan Sea.

26:17.200 --> 26:18.880
In order to switch back,

26:19.440 --> 26:20.840
we waited for lightning at night.

26:22.200 --> 26:23.520
Just like now,

26:24.440 --> 26:25.680
it was just the two of us.

26:26.160 --> 26:27.720
We talked together

26:28.800 --> 26:29.880
and looked at the night sky.

26:30.560 --> 26:31.840
No one disturbed us.

26:31.920 --> 26:33.160
Do you remember?

26:38.040 --> 26:39.080
Yes.

26:40.800 --> 26:42.480
You were so silly

26:43.080 --> 26:44.440
and thought I would eat you.

26:45.800 --> 26:47.040
It's weird.

26:47.560 --> 26:49.640
We've only known each other
for three months,

26:50.720 --> 26:52.960
but I feel like I have known you
for 30,000 years.

26:53.520 --> 26:55.640
I've seen you wearing the clothes
of the Fairy Tribe,

26:56.320 --> 26:58.320
the Moon Tribe,

26:58.880 --> 27:01.080
and now of mortals.

27:01.800 --> 27:03.080
But the most beautiful one on you

27:04.840 --> 27:06.600
is the wedding dress tonight.

27:35.640 --> 27:36.960
Drink with me.

27:48.080 --> 27:49.880
Although today's wedding is fake,

27:50.880 --> 27:52.880
I am very happy.

27:52.960 --> 27:54.200
It's like

27:56.600 --> 27:58.040
I'm really married.

28:24.560 --> 28:26.000
Moon Supreme Lord,

28:29.360 --> 28:31.920
why did you really come to Lucheng?

28:33.080 --> 28:35.080
Can you tell me the truth?

28:41.160 --> 28:42.960
Haven't I already told you?

28:43.640 --> 28:45.240
It has nothing to do with you.

28:45.320 --> 28:46.480
You don't need to ask anymore.

28:47.440 --> 28:49.920
You plan to kill my tribesman and friends.

28:52.120 --> 28:53.800
Does that have nothing to do with me too?

29:00.480 --> 29:01.480
Who told you that?

29:04.040 --> 29:06.880
So it's true?

29:20.240 --> 29:21.920
Didn't you promise me

29:24.720 --> 29:26.640
that you won't lie to me again?

29:28.120 --> 29:30.080
You know I'm the Moon Tribe's leader.

29:30.960 --> 29:33.480
Why do you ask such a question?

29:34.080 --> 29:36.640
I want to destroy Shuiyuntian
and avenge the Moon Tribe.

29:38.200 --> 29:40.080
Don't you already know that?

29:40.560 --> 29:41.720
But…

29:42.520 --> 29:44.960
But after living in Lucheng,

29:45.040 --> 29:46.840
I thought you already liked

29:46.920 --> 29:48.720
the peaceful life.

29:48.800 --> 29:49.720
Besides,

29:50.680 --> 29:52.720
haven't you and Xiao Run
already become friends?

29:52.800 --> 29:54.040
Yes.

29:56.200 --> 29:57.320
He is Xiao Run.

29:58.840 --> 29:59.960
But he's not Changheng.

30:02.840 --> 30:05.280
I can never forget
the thousands of years of hatred

30:05.360 --> 30:06.680
between the Moon and Fairy Tribes.

30:07.640 --> 30:08.640
I will still kill him

30:08.720 --> 30:10.240
when I meet him in a war in the future.

30:10.320 --> 30:11.560
I won't hesitate.

30:11.640 --> 30:12.520
As for you,

30:18.000 --> 30:19.760
if you'll hate me because of this,

30:21.160 --> 30:22.040
go ahead.

30:49.840 --> 30:50.680
My lord.

30:50.760 --> 30:53.400
What if she goes back on her word
and doesn't poison Dongfang Qingcang?

30:53.480 --> 30:54.880
What should we do?

30:54.960 --> 30:55.800
It doesn't matter.

30:56.600 --> 30:58.240
That poison is just a cover.

31:06.920 --> 31:09.520
What can really hurt Dongfang Qingcang

31:11.000 --> 31:14.480
is the evil qi
from killing 3,000 heavenly soldiers.

32:43.400 --> 32:44.280
Master.

32:45.440 --> 32:46.480
I'm Hao.

32:52.600 --> 32:53.640
Come on.

32:55.800 --> 32:57.360
Let me take you

32:59.560 --> 33:01.320
to where you came from.

33:17.800 --> 33:18.960
I don't hate you.

33:20.520 --> 33:22.280
There are people in Fairy Tribe

33:22.920 --> 33:24.880
and there are people in Moon Tribe too.

33:25.600 --> 33:26.840
The families of 100,000 soldiers

33:26.920 --> 33:28.960
are still waiting for them to come home.

33:29.800 --> 33:31.120
You are the Moon Supreme

33:31.600 --> 33:33.480
and their hope.

33:33.560 --> 33:35.360
How can I hate you?

33:38.880 --> 33:40.400
But now…

33:42.400 --> 33:46.160
But now, I don't know what to do either.

34:54.360 --> 34:56.400
Cricket, why are you wearing
women's clothes?

34:56.480 --> 34:58.000
I'm not Cricket.

34:58.560 --> 34:59.640
My name is Danyin.

35:00.280 --> 35:01.360
Did you change your name?

35:01.440 --> 35:03.360
I just ascended back to Shuiyuntian.

35:04.320 --> 35:05.160
Now,

35:05.240 --> 35:06.520
Lord Changheng,

35:06.600 --> 35:07.800
you should go back too.

35:09.360 --> 35:10.640
Lord?

35:11.560 --> 35:13.400
I'm Xiao Run.

35:13.480 --> 35:14.720
Lucheng is my home.

35:14.800 --> 35:16.360
Are you drunk or am I drunk?

35:16.440 --> 35:17.480
Where should I go back to?

35:17.560 --> 35:18.920
- Your name is Changheng.
- Me?

35:19.000 --> 35:20.880
You're Shuiyuntian's God of War.

35:21.440 --> 35:22.920
Stop kidding, Cricket.

35:23.000 --> 35:24.120
God of War?

35:24.200 --> 35:25.240
I can't even defeat you.

35:25.320 --> 35:26.560
What kind of God of War is that?

35:27.640 --> 35:29.280
I'm not Qu Shui.

35:29.360 --> 35:30.760
Xiao Run,

35:30.840 --> 35:32.600
Mr. Dongfang,

35:32.680 --> 35:34.160
everything is fake.

35:36.000 --> 35:36.840
Fake?

35:36.920 --> 35:37.920
It's all fake!

35:38.480 --> 35:40.320
Lady Orchid is fake too.

35:40.400 --> 35:42.000
Orchid will not marry you.

35:42.080 --> 35:44.840
Dongfang Qingcang isn't planning
to marry Xie Wanqing either.

35:44.920 --> 35:47.080
This wedding is all fake too.

35:56.560 --> 35:58.120
I believe

35:58.920 --> 36:01.080
you won't ignore Changheng.

36:02.800 --> 36:04.040
Leave now!

36:05.000 --> 36:05.960
Orchid!

36:48.920 --> 36:49.760
No!

36:49.840 --> 36:51.120
Don't come over!

36:51.200 --> 36:52.480
You will get hurt.

36:55.040 --> 36:58.680
- I want you to die a cruel death!
- Why? Why are you treating me this way?

36:58.760 --> 37:02.440
- Why?
- Why? Why are you treating me this way?

37:02.520 --> 37:07.680
- Why?
- Why? Why are you treating me this way?

37:07.760 --> 37:10.760
- You took him away.
- Why? Why are you treating me this way?

37:10.840 --> 37:12.440
You took him.

37:20.240 --> 37:21.120
No!

37:25.600 --> 37:27.680
Don't come over. You will get hurt!

37:32.640 --> 37:34.360
Go.

37:49.120 --> 37:50.640
Lady Wanqing?

37:52.560 --> 37:53.480
Lady Wanqing.

37:53.560 --> 37:54.960
- This is evil qi.
- What's wrong?

37:57.360 --> 37:58.960
I've seen it in the immortal examination.

37:59.880 --> 38:00.760
What's wrong?

38:36.240 --> 38:38.080
Big Blockhead, don't come over anymore!

38:38.160 --> 38:39.320
You will get hurt.

38:43.960 --> 38:45.040
Be careful!

38:55.240 --> 38:56.440
Lady Wanqing.

39:18.800 --> 39:19.920
You can't die.

39:20.960 --> 39:22.960
Your spirit will dissipate if you die.

39:24.480 --> 39:25.600
You won't die.

39:26.120 --> 39:27.400
As long as you succeed in tribulation,

39:28.080 --> 39:30.040
you'll ascend back
to being Lord Changheng.

39:31.120 --> 39:32.000
Lord Changheng.

39:33.440 --> 39:34.920
Hang in there.

39:37.160 --> 39:38.000
Cricket,

39:39.240 --> 39:40.160
why are you

39:41.920 --> 39:43.400
still calling me Lord?

39:44.360 --> 39:45.440
I…

39:45.520 --> 39:48.640
I am Xiao Run.

39:59.520 --> 40:00.440
Xiao Run.

40:04.000 --> 40:05.040
Xiao Run.

40:06.240 --> 40:07.480
Xiao Run!

40:21.680 --> 40:22.560
Big Blockhead.

40:28.600 --> 40:29.440
Are…

40:30.120 --> 40:31.160
Are you all right?

40:32.880 --> 40:35.240
It's just evil qi. Don't worry.

40:42.560 --> 40:43.640
The poison wine and the bead

40:44.120 --> 40:45.760
came from the same person, right?

40:47.960 --> 40:49.000
Who is it?

40:51.720 --> 40:53.200
Lord Ronghao.

40:54.160 --> 40:56.560
Lady Chidi's one and only disciple.

40:59.440 --> 41:00.360
You're still injured.

41:00.440 --> 41:01.280
Where are you going?

41:01.360 --> 41:03.480
To do what I should do.

41:04.640 --> 41:05.480
Big Blockhead.

41:06.120 --> 41:07.120
Big Blockhead!

41:12.720 --> 41:13.680
My lord!

41:14.320 --> 41:15.160
My lord.

41:16.120 --> 41:17.240
You are injured.

41:18.160 --> 41:19.600
- What happened--
- It doesn't matter.

41:19.680 --> 41:21.760
Are Xiao Run and Xie Wanqing missing?

41:26.480 --> 41:28.320
Go find them!

41:28.400 --> 41:30.960
Lady Chidi's primordial spirit
is the key to unlocking the seal.

41:31.040 --> 41:33.320
It decides whether 100,000 soldiers
will come back or not.

41:33.400 --> 41:34.440
No mistake is allowed.

41:34.520 --> 41:35.680
Yes.

42:26.800 --> 42:27.840
Xiao Run.

42:39.360 --> 42:41.160
I'll avenge you.

42:43.560 --> 42:45.560
Big Blockhead!

42:47.440 --> 42:48.320
Big Blockhead.

42:49.440 --> 42:50.440
Big Blockhead!

42:52.480 --> 42:53.840
Where are you?

42:57.920 --> 42:59.200
Lady Wanqing.

42:59.280 --> 43:00.480
What are you doing?

43:11.320 --> 43:12.560
Lady Wanqing.

43:13.880 --> 43:15.480
Why did you choose her

43:15.560 --> 43:16.960
over me?

43:18.840 --> 43:20.920
You betrayed me for this woman.

43:21.000 --> 43:22.560
Give my husband back.

43:22.640 --> 43:24.200
You took him away.

43:24.280 --> 43:25.440
You took him away.

43:25.920 --> 43:27.920
What?

43:28.000 --> 43:29.680
You took him away!

43:30.640 --> 43:31.600
It's evil qi.

43:31.680 --> 43:33.000
Lady Wanqing.

43:33.080 --> 43:34.800
You're poisoned by evil qi.

43:34.880 --> 43:36.240
Let go of me.

43:36.320 --> 43:38.280
Lady Wanqing, wake up!
